ddress":"河内郡上三川町","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"09301","municipality_pref":"栃木県","municipality_name":"上三川町","municipality_code_method":"nearest_centroid"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[139.87836417,36.45508874]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"parks_playgrounds","name":"宮公園","category":"nature","address":"河内郡上三川町","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"09301","municipality_pref":"栃木県","municipality_name":"上三川町","municipality_code_method":"nearest_centroid"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[139.87040606,36.43524957]}}],"display_comment_original":"上三川町周辺には、近世村の記憶として上三川村、三本木村、三村などの旧村名が見える。 この地域には寺社や信仰の場、城跡や陣屋跡、史跡や遺跡に関わる場所が見え、上三川城跡、上神主遺跡、密興寺跡のような地点が探索の入口になる。 現地では史跡説明板、上三川村、三本木村ゆかりの旧境石標や村の歴史案内板が手がかりになりそうだ。さらに水辺の暮らしや堤防整備の歴史を示す案内板に加え、治水碑や河川改修の記念碑が狙い目になる。","story_enrichment":{"samurai_priority_people":[],"notable_people":["吉澤章","野澤一郎","小堀保三郎"],"honorary_citizens":[],"tourism_landmarks":["白鷺神社","多功城","上三川城","インターパーク宇都宮南","上三川ホースパーク","かみのかわサンフラワー祭り"],"specialties":["黒チャーハン"],"food_culture":[],"historical_domains":[],"heian_place_names":[],"japan_search_support":["仮面 かお https://jpsearch.go.jp/item/adeac-R100000094_I1456543","額 おながどり https://jpsearch.go.jp/item/adeac-R100000094_I1456515","巳 https://jpsearch.go.jp/item/adeac-R100000094_I1456525"],"enrichment_sources":["https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%B8%8A%E4%B8%89%E5%B7%9D%E7%94%BA","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q209200","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q110774373","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11459491","https://jpsearch.go.jp/csearch/jps-cross?csid=jps-cross&keyword=%E5%90%89%E6%BE%A4%E7%AB%A0&keyword=%E4%B8%8A%E4%B8%89%E5%B7%9D%E7%94%BA"],"enrichment_errors":[],"wikipedia_title":"上三川町","wikipedia_revision_id":"109846185","wikidata_qid":"Q1345604","wikipedia_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%B8%8A%E4%B8%89%E5%B7%9D%E7%94%BA","japan_search_query_url":"https://jpsearch.go.jp/csearch/jps-cross?csid=jps-cross&keyword=%E5%90%89%E6%BE%A4%E7%AB%A0&keyword=%E4%B8%8A%E4%B